(4539319, 654033, 3554, '<td valign="top">I generally like abstracts but the lamp in the background (or what appears to be a lamp) makes this shot feel ordinary, if that makes sense. <br/> <br/>I''m wondering if you had cropped it just to the right of the red/white circles if it would be stronger.<br/> <br/>Good idea though and I really like the points where the tines touch the liquid.</td>', 'I generally like abstracts but the lamp in the background (or what appears to be a lamp) makes this shot feel ordinary, if that makes sense.  I''m wondering if you had cropped it just to the right of the red/white circles if it would be stronger. Good idea though and I really like the points where the tines touch the liquid.', '2008-03-05 00:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
