(4539544, 654604, 49578, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, the way it occupies the diagonal. But i feel the crop would have looked better were it a bit more in the height dimension, AND the diagonals were still occupied the way they are.</td>', 'I like the composition, the way it occupies the diagonal. But i feel the crop would have looked better were it a bit more in the height dimension, AND the diagonals were still occupied the way they are.', '2008-03-05 01:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539546, 654559, 49578, '<td valign="top">It is very difficult for me to co-relate the title and the picture. If I consider the picture independently, i like the position of the spoon in the frame. I do not like that something yellow peeking from the top right corner of the frame</td>', 'It is very difficult for me to co-relate the title and the picture. If I consider the picture independently, i like the position of the spoon in the frame. I do not like that something yellow peeking from the top right corner of the frame', '2008-03-05 01:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539547, 654512, 49578, '<td valign="top">I like the curve of the object on which the fork leans. I do not know of the spot on that object was intentional, but i would have liked more diffused light. I like the composition in general</td>', 'I like the curve of the object on which the fork leans. I do not know of the spot on that object was intentional, but i would have liked more diffused light. I like the composition in general', '2008-03-05 01:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539548, 654373, 90784, '<td valign="top">It feels grainy and the lighting lacks interest. You picked a very hard message to convey.</td>', 'It feels grainy and the lighting lacks interest. You picked a very hard message to convey.', '2008-03-05 01:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539550, 652588, 49578, '<td valign="top">This is a really different picture, and the PoV is great. I like the focus on the silverware. But probably a bit more illumination/colour could have added more interest. TO me the picture looks a bit dull.</td>', 'This is a really different picture, and the PoV is great. I like the focus on the silverware. But probably a bit more illumination/colour could have added more interest. TO me the picture looks a bit dull.', '2008-03-05 01:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539552, 654283, 90784, '<td valign="top">Its hard to tell what''s happening. the flash flattens the image and makes it look as if both spoons are on the table. Lots of dead space in this photo too. Maybe you could try another angle.</td>', 'Its hard to tell what''s happening. the flash flattens the image and makes it look as if both spoons are on the table. Lots of dead space in this photo too. Maybe you could try another angle.', '2008-03-05 01:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539555, 654762, 90784, '<td valign="top">the lighting makes the surface/backdrop look dirty. The spoon is a bit funky too. Perhaps they could have been spooning...</td>', 'the lighting makes the surface/backdrop look dirty. The spoon is a bit funky too. Perhaps they could have been spooning...', '2008-03-05 02:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539560, 654483, 90784, '<td valign="top">Not sure what to do to help this photo. Maybe a spoon instead of a knife... the knife almost makes it look like the dog is being cut. Natural light would have helped a lot too.</td>', 'Not sure what to do to help this photo. Maybe a spoon instead of a knife... the knife almost makes it look like the dog is being cut. Natural light would have helped a lot too.', '2008-03-05 02:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539566, 654050, 90784, '<td valign="top">I would like to see lighting that was less flat. The placement is not quite centered.</td>', 'I would like to see lighting that was less flat. The placement is not quite centered.', '2008-03-05 02:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539568, 653842, 90784, '<td valign="top">Good idea to tip the image. I wish there were more of a central point of focus. I also wish there was some silverware.</td>', 'Good idea to tip the image. I wish there were more of a central point of focus. I also wish there was some silverware.', '2008-03-05 02:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539570, 653777, 90784, '<td valign="top">silverware?</td>', 'silverware?', '2008-03-05 02:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
