(4539622, 654371, 49578, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, the lighting, though i am not quite sure about the diagonal which makes the top left corner more illuminated. but maybe, that adds to the overall dynamics. Like the selective desat too</td>', 'I like the composition, the lighting, though i am not quite sure about the diagonal which makes the top left corner more illuminated. but maybe, that adds to the overall dynamics. Like the selective desat too', '2008-03-05 03:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539675, 652720, 49578, '<td valign="top">I feel the crop is a little too tight on the left side. Could have helped the picture with a little more space there. Instead of the white cotton background, a smoother background could have helpd. Also, the highlight on the apple is a bit bothering</td>', 'I feel the crop is a little too tight on the left side. Could have helped the picture with a little more space there. Instead of the white cotton background, a smoother background could have helpd. Also, the highlight on the apple is a bit bothering', '2008-03-05 03:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539679, 654218, 49578, '<td valign="top">I am not too fond of the saturated and/or inverted colours for the pear. Frankly, i would have loved the picture with just the spoon and the fork. The negative space would have looked nice. But of course this is just my personal opinion. I like the lighting of the silverware a lot.</td>', 'I am not too fond of the saturated and/or inverted colours for the pear. Frankly, i would have loved the picture with just the spoon and the fork. The negative space would have looked nice. But of course this is just my personal opinion. I like the lighting of the silverware a lot.', '2008-03-05 03:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
