(4539791, 654784, 5354, '<td valign="top">Lighting is flat and doesn''t help by having the room reflected in the silverware. Try using a small light tent or white sheet to block out those reflections</td>', 'Lighting is flat and doesn''t help by having the room reflected in the silverware. Try using a small light tent or white sheet to block out those reflections', '2008-03-05 05:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539793, 653777, 90495, '<td valign="top">Silverware? I don''t think needles fit into this category. Nice shot though.</td>', 'Silverware? I don''t think needles fit into this category. Nice shot though.', '2008-03-05 05:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539794, 654658, 5354, '<td valign="top">A decent ''record'' shot, but no artistic interpretation</td>', 'A decent ''record'' shot, but no artistic interpretation', '2008-03-05 05:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539795, 653648, 49578, '<td valign="top">Would have been a much better poicture had the background been otherwise free of the disturbing reflections</td>', 'Would have been a much better poicture had the background been otherwise free of the disturbing reflections', '2008-03-05 05:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539796, 652911, 5354, '<td valign="top">The backround needs some work to clean it up, it is distracting at the moment.</td>', 'The backround needs some work to clean it up, it is distracting at the moment.', '2008-03-05 05:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539813, 654518, 68546, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but needed a fill on the top to light the spoon. Also the crop is way too tight at the top</td>', 'Nice idea but needed a fill on the top to light the spoon. Also the crop is way too tight at the top', '2008-03-05 05:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539818, 653896, 85374, '<td valign="top">If it was all in focus it would be great</td>', 'If it was all in focus it would be great', '2008-03-05 05:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539842, 654531, 32011, '<td valign="top">Nice shot... title''s an issue though... the fork isn''t "in" the road... it''s "on" the road.  Beautiful photo though...</td>', 'Nice shot... title''s an issue though... the fork isn''t "in" the road... it''s "on" the road.  Beautiful photo though...', '2008-03-05 06:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539845, 652588, 32011, '<td valign="top">Brilliant concept.  I like the effective use of DOF and space of the right.  Well done.</td>', 'Brilliant concept.  I like the effective use of DOF and space of the right.  Well done.', '2008-03-05 06:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539846, 653772, 32011, '<td valign="top">Background is a bit distracting.  I love the idea, and the effort you''ve put into actually getting the fork "IN" the road.</td>', 'Background is a bit distracting.  I love the idea, and the effort you''ve put into actually getting the fork "IN" the road.', '2008-03-05 06:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539848, 654497, 32011, '<td valign="top">Great photo... at first it''s a fairly standard (well taken, but standard) shot of cutlery etc... but on greater inspection your greeted with a nice surprise... that there''s more to this than just a knife, fork, plate and green vegetable.  Well don.</td>', 'Great photo... at first it''s a fairly standard (well taken, but standard) shot of cutlery etc... but on greater inspection your greeted with a nice surprise... that there''s more to this than just a knife, fork, plate and green vegetable.  Well don.', '2008-03-05 06:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539852, 653974, 32011, '<td valign="top">I didn''t think I''d see this technique attempted in this challenge... I didn''t see how... I was wrong  :(<br/> <br/>Nice shot...</td>', 'I didn''t think I''d see this technique attempted in this challenge... I didn''t see how... I was wrong  :( Nice shot...', '2008-03-05 06:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539853, 654742, 88010, '<td valign="top">This would have ben way cool if you had cropped really tight to the spoon.</td>', 'This would have ben way cool if you had cropped really tight to the spoon.', '2008-03-05 06:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539854, 653913, 90495, '<td valign="top">If this was just a bit more in focus, not too much, but just a tad. At first glance it looks like some sort of metal container.</td>', 'If this was just a bit more in focus, not too much, but just a tad. At first glance it looks like some sort of metal container.', '2008-03-05 06:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539855, 654742, 51538, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Using a 100mm f/2.8 or lens with similar potential to isolate the spoon from the background, and throw the background into colourful bokeh, and this would have been even better, IMO. 6.</td>', 'Great idea.  Using a 100mm f/2.8 or lens with similar potential to isolate the spoon from the background, and throw the background into colourful bokeh, and this would have been even better, IMO. 6.', '2008-03-05 06:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539859, 654604, 51538, '<td valign="top">The word tine is rather nice.  I bet not so many people know what it means.  I like the composition.</td>', 'The word tine is rather nice.  I bet not so many people know what it means.  I like the composition.', '2008-03-05 06:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539878, 654508, 90849, '<td valign="top">Really cool!  I love the originality and made me laugh too.  Rock On!</td>', 'Really cool!  I love the originality and made me laugh too.  Rock On!', '2008-03-05 06:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539893, 653225, 90849, '<td valign="top">At first sight I was wondering.  Then I saw the knife.  The idea is brilliant and I love it.  But I would emphasize on the knife to make it visible at the first glance. :)</td>', 'At first sight I was wondering.  Then I saw the knife.  The idea is brilliant and I love it.  But I would emphasize on the knife to make it visible at the first glance. :)', '2008-03-05 07:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539896, 654687, 90849, '<td valign="top">Very unusual and imaginative!  I very like it.  Good luck!</td>', 'Very unusual and imaginative!  I very like it.  Good luck!', '2008-03-05 07:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539902, 654612, 88613, '<td valign="top">Simple, yet very well composed and clean focus. Great shot!</td>', 'Simple, yet very well composed and clean focus. Great shot!', '2008-03-05 07:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539904, 654749, 90849, '<td valign="top">Changing the orientation of the picture is truly a wonderful idea.  It really gave me the impression that the fork has been blasted with water coming from the side of it!</td>', 'Changing the orientation of the picture is truly a wonderful idea.  It really gave me the impression that the fork has been blasted with water coming from the side of it!', '2008-03-05 07:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539905, 654320, 88613, '<td valign="top">I think it would have been better with a little more depth of focus but that is a neat looking set of silverware.</td>', 'I think it would have been better with a little more depth of focus but that is a neat looking set of silverware.', '2008-03-05 07:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539928, 654760, 84656, '<td valign="top">With the frame so tight, I think the objects should be symmetrical.  Lovely teaspoons.</td>', 'With the frame so tight, I think the objects should be symmetrical.  Lovely teaspoons.', '2008-03-05 07:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539939, 654684, 90495, '<td valign="top">Your border makes it obvious that there is a lack of true blacks in your shot.</td>', 'Your border makes it obvious that there is a lack of true blacks in your shot.', '2008-03-05 07:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539998, 653842, 32837, '<td valign="top">DNMC I  believe it needs Silverware in it...</td>', 'DNMC I  believe it needs Silverware in it...', '2008-03-05 08:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539999, 654032, 32837, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting</td>', 'Nice lighting', '2008-03-05 08:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4540000, 653974, 32837, '<td valign="top">Took a moment but I get it now. Pretty.</td>', 'Took a moment but I get it now. Pretty.', '2008-03-05 08:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4540010, 654084, 32837, '<td valign="top">A bit dark.</td>', 'A bit dark.', '2008-03-05 08:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4540016, 653560, 32837, '<td valign="top">out of focus...</td>', 'out of focus...', '2008-03-05 08:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
