(4540605, 653224, 26001, '<td valign="top">brilliant idea and very well setup. exposure is nice. i like the "grainy" feel too. did not care too much about high-key treatment though. seems like you took a short-cut to control light-reflections hehehe so will take-off one point :) 9 from me</td>', 'brilliant idea and very well setup. exposure is nice. i like the "grainy" feel too. did not care too much about high-key treatment though. seems like you took a short-cut to control light-reflections hehehe so will take-off one point :) 9 from me', '2008-03-05 12:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
