(4540860, 654041, 35947, '<td valign="top">Creative and unique idea.  Wish the carpet didn''t have such texture to it in places, I think it would really make the "star" pop.</td>', 'Creative and unique idea.  Wish the carpet didn''t have such texture to it in places, I think it would really make the "star" pop.', '2008-03-05 13:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4540864, 654249, 90658, '<td valign="top">I would suggest that the glue bottle should have been moved a bit so that the brand name wasn''t there.  The blue, even though not the focal point, is rather obvious.  Otherwise and interesting idea.</td>', 'I would suggest that the glue bottle should have been moved a bit so that the brand name wasn''t there.  The blue, even though not the focal point, is rather obvious.  Otherwise and interesting idea.', '2008-03-05 13:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
