(4540876, 654742, 90658, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect with the reflection in the back of the spoon.  I find it a pleasing "art" shot, in that it is entirely different.  Not sure it will score where you want it to since it is entirely different.</td>', 'Interesting effect with the reflection in the back of the spoon.  I find it a pleasing "art" shot, in that it is entirely different.  Not sure it will score where you want it to since it is entirely different.', '2008-03-05 13:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
