(4540900, 653460, 35947, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I wonder how this would look if it wasn''t so straight on, like if you rotated it about 45 degrees.</td>', 'Interesting.  I wonder how this would look if it wasn''t so straight on, like if you rotated it about 45 degrees.', '2008-03-05 13:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
