(4540908, 654453, 90658, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, I don''t see a knife, fork or spoon here.  The image is interesting, but I fail to see the relevence to the challenge; other than the subtle reference in the title to a dishwasher.  If there is a piece of silverware in this shot, I apologize for my lack of perception.</td>', 'I''m sorry, I don''t see a knife, fork or spoon here.  The image is interesting, but I fail to see the relevence to the challenge; other than the subtle reference in the title to a dishwasher.  If there is a piece of silverware in this shot, I apologize for my lack of perception.', '2008-03-05 13:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4540910, 654760, 35947, '<td valign="top">Focus could be a little sharper.</td>', 'Focus could be a little sharper.', '2008-03-05 13:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4540912, 654483, 90658, '<td valign="top">I think the knife should be the center of focus, otherwise it is a snapshot of your dog being a dog.</td>', 'I think the knife should be the center of focus, otherwise it is a snapshot of your dog being a dog.', '2008-03-05 13:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4540925, 654478, 35947, '<td valign="top">Excellent image!</td>', 'Excellent image!', '2008-03-05 13:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4540931, 654732, 90658, '<td valign="top">So much going on here.  What is the focus?  If it is the reflections in the spoons, as the title suggests, I would crop out everything below the tip of the nose and really accentuate the reflections.  If it is the use of spoons to be wacky glasses, the light umbrellas, tv, coffee table and general "clutter" in the reflection need to be mitigated somehow.</td>', 'So much going on here.  What is the focus?  If it is the reflections in the spoons, as the title suggests, I would crop out everything below the tip of the nose and really accentuate the reflections.  If it is the use of spoons to be wacky glasses, the light umbrellas, tv, coffee table and general "clutter" in the reflection need to be mitigated somehow.', '2008-03-05 13:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4540933, 653777, 35947, '<td valign="top">Nice focus on the drop.  Not sure if a needle would fit in with silverware in the traditional sense.</td>', 'Nice focus on the drop.  Not sure if a needle would fit in with silverware in the traditional sense.', '2008-03-05 13:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
