(4545466, 653777, 88254, '<td valign="top">Cool shot - but silverware?  I think they were talking about eating utensils.</td>', 'Cool shot - but silverware?  I think they were talking about eating utensils.', '2008-03-07 11:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545472, 654518, 88254, '<td valign="top">Impressive!  Want to hear how you did this.</td>', 'Impressive!  Want to hear how you did this.', '2008-03-07 11:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545478, 653476, 88254, '<td valign="top">Unappetizing on two levels (and brings back memories...)</td>', 'Unappetizing on two levels (and brings back memories...)', '2008-03-07 11:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545629, 652562, 16402, '<td valign="top">Sorry, DNMC, IMHO. Cool shot though.</td>', 'Sorry, DNMC, IMHO. Cool shot though.', '2008-03-07 13:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545632, 654399, 90495, '<td valign="top">This will be top 10 for sure. Very nice look you''ve achieved here. The soft lighting accentuating the metallic curves is beautiful. The reflections being oof is nice too. 10</td>', 'This will be top 10 for sure. Very nice look you''ve achieved here. The soft lighting accentuating the metallic curves is beautiful. The reflections being oof is nice too. 10', '2008-03-07 13:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545633, 653918, 90495, '<td valign="top">Nice placement of these 2 forks. Good comp.</td>', 'Nice placement of these 2 forks. Good comp.', '2008-03-07 13:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545634, 654295, 90495, '<td valign="top">Well photographed. I love the contrast and the lines. Great shot!</td>', 'Well photographed. I love the contrast and the lines. Great shot!', '2008-03-07 13:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545637, 654405, 16402, '<td valign="top">Think a different perspective (although I can''t exactly say what) would have really made this pop. As it is, at first glance I couldn''t tell they were actually balanced.</td>', 'Think a different perspective (although I can''t exactly say what) would have really made this pop. As it is, at first glance I couldn''t tell they were actually balanced.', '2008-03-07 13:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545638, 653656, 90495, '<td valign="top">I get this overall flat feel to this pic. But on the other hand I like the softness it has too.</td>', 'I get this overall flat feel to this pic. But on the other hand I like the softness it has too.', '2008-03-07 13:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545641, 653803, 16402, '<td valign="top">Don''t get the title, sorry.</td>', 'Don''t get the title, sorry.', '2008-03-07 13:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545644, 654607, 90495, '<td valign="top">The smudge is bothersome on the eyes, first thing I noticed. I like this pic a lot though. Good job photographing them. 8.5</td>', 'The smudge is bothersome on the eyes, first thing I noticed. I like this pic a lot though. Good job photographing them. 8.5', '2008-03-07 13:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545645, 654709, 16402, '<td valign="top">Great job of using contrast. 7</td>', 'Great job of using contrast. 7', '2008-03-07 13:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545854, 653624, 90663, '<td valign="top">I dunno, I"m anti "spork" myself... ;)<br/>highlights are a little hot for my taste, but clever use of the "spork" as a hybrid of the spoon and fork in the background</td>', 'I dunno, I"m anti "spork" myself... ;)highlights are a little hot for my taste, but clever use of the "spork" as a hybrid of the spoon and fork in the background', '2008-03-07 14:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545866, 654364, 90663, '<td valign="top">LOL...nice pattern</td>', 'LOL...nice pattern', '2008-03-07 14:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545876, 653225, 90663, '<td valign="top">Seems a little soft, nice composition though</td>', 'Seems a little soft, nice composition though', '2008-03-07 14:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545880, 654295, 90663, '<td valign="top">Cool semi-abstract, good soft lighting to avoid hot spots on the metal</td>', 'Cool semi-abstract, good soft lighting to avoid hot spots on the metal', '2008-03-07 14:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545882, 654569, 90663, '<td valign="top">Nice macro effort, I would have put more of the knife in the frame, perhaps a more diagonal angle</td>', 'Nice macro effort, I would have put more of the knife in the frame, perhaps a more diagonal angle', '2008-03-07 14:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545888, 653399, 90663, '<td valign="top">Sorry, this one just isn''t doing much for me, a little too chaotic</td>', 'Sorry, this one just isn''t doing much for me, a little too chaotic', '2008-03-07 14:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545892, 654554, 90663, '<td valign="top">Don''t know how this will score overall but I like it--the way the spoon is bent makes it look like it has "surrendered"</td>', 'Don''t know how this will score overall but I like it--the way the spoon is bent makes it look like it has "surrendered"', '2008-03-07 14:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545896, 654538, 90663, '<td valign="top">The black on black makes your subject kind of hard to see.  Maybe if you had put the shattered fork on the yellow line?</td>', 'The black on black makes your subject kind of hard to see.  Maybe if you had put the shattered fork on the yellow line?', '2008-03-07 14:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545898, 653460, 90663, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to see more sharpness in the details of the spoon</td>', 'Would have liked to see more sharpness in the details of the spoon', '2008-03-07 14:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545901, 653697, 16402, '<td valign="top">Great graphical quality and use of contrast.</td>', 'Great graphical quality and use of contrast.', '2008-03-07 14:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545908, 653224, 16402, '<td valign="top">that''s kinda clever.</td>', 'that''s kinda clever.', '2008-03-07 14:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546146, 652951, 16402, '<td valign="top">Biggest table knife I''ve ever seen. Cool photo though.</td>', 'Biggest table knife I''ve ever seen. Cool photo though.', '2008-03-07 16:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546256, 653627, 90495, '<td valign="top">Smoke is nice but the spoon looks blurred.</td>', 'Smoke is nice but the spoon looks blurred.', '2008-03-07 16:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546265, 654032, 90495, '<td valign="top">The left fork is higher than the right one, breaking the symmetry you were trying to achieve. Otherwise this is well exposed and it has a nice feel to it.</td>', 'The left fork is higher than the right one, breaking the symmetry you were trying to achieve. Otherwise this is well exposed and it has a nice feel to it.', '2008-03-07 17:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546272, 653874, 90495, '<td valign="top">The dust definitely does not help here. It also looks underexposed at the fork''s business end.</td>', 'The dust definitely does not help here. It also looks underexposed at the fork''s business end.', '2008-03-07 17:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546277, 652547, 90495, '<td valign="top">Neat concept. I would have liked to have seen more spoon though, not just a reflection of a fork on a shiny object. Your title helped.</td>', 'Neat concept. I would have liked to have seen more spoon though, not just a reflection of a fork on a shiny object. Your title helped.', '2008-03-07 17:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546278, 652962, 90495, '<td valign="top">Well executed.</td>', 'Well executed.', '2008-03-07 17:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546347, 654532, 88054, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo. A little washed out near the top but very well done. One of my top ten.</td>', 'I really like this photo. A little washed out near the top but very well done. One of my top ten.', '2008-03-07 17:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546360, 654203, 88054, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done. One of my top ten.</td>', 'Beautifully done. One of my top ten.', '2008-03-07 17:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546371, 654222, 88054, '<td valign="top">Very clever. A little unbalanced...Too much negative space on the right and uneven spacing between forks. -1 for an otherwise well above average effort. Very nice.</td>', 'Very clever. A little unbalanced...Too much negative space on the right and uneven spacing between forks. -1 for an otherwise well above average effort. Very nice.', '2008-03-07 17:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546403, 653896, 69368, '<td valign="top">like the DOF and the tones!</td>', 'like the DOF and the tones!', '2008-03-07 18:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546587, 654277, 69246, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a bit direct and harsh. Try diffusing for a softer feel</td>', 'The lighting is a bit direct and harsh. Try diffusing for a softer feel', '2008-03-07 19:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546588, 654669, 88054, '<td valign="top">Quality effort. There are so many great photos. This is also one of my favorites.</td>', 'Quality effort. There are so many great photos. This is also one of my favorites.', '2008-03-07 19:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546589, 652951, 53509, '<td valign="top">I like the expression and the clarity in the knife. I wish the background complemented the photo more... it seems rather ordinary for such an extraordinary situation</td>', 'I like the expression and the clarity in the knife. I wish the background complemented the photo more... it seems rather ordinary for such an extraordinary situation', '2008-03-07 19:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546591, 653399, 53509, '<td valign="top">Good sharpness. I don''t think the arrangement of the cutlery helps you here, and the background is a bit cluttered. I''m not sure where to look.</td>', 'Good sharpness. I don''t think the arrangement of the cutlery helps you here, and the background is a bit cluttered. I''m not sure where to look.', '2008-03-07 19:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546592, 653974, 88054, '<td valign="top">Another quality image. There are so many creative minds out there. Very well done.</td>', 'Another quality image. There are so many creative minds out there. Very well done.', '2008-03-07 19:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546593, 654032, 53509, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of lighting and I like how the forks disappear into the distance.</td>', 'Excellent use of lighting and I like how the forks disappear into the distance.', '2008-03-07 19:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546594, 653913, 69246, '<td valign="top">Exactly. Its way too small.....</td>', 'Exactly. Its way too small.....', '2008-03-07 19:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546596, 654699, 53509, '<td valign="top">The photo matches the title well. The fork looks too scratched to be the central focus in this image and is not sharp enough. The lighting seems a little flat, too.</td>', 'The photo matches the title well. The fork looks too scratched to be the central focus in this image and is not sharp enough. The lighting seems a little flat, too.', '2008-03-07 20:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546597, 654480, 69246, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a bit harsh and direct, most likely from the on-camera flash.</td>', 'The lighting is a bit harsh and direct, most likely from the on-camera flash.', '2008-03-07 20:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546598, 654534, 53509, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here and the title. Perhaps a different angle would help - I find the half-reflections of the red cloth distracting.Also, the knife looks scratched.</td>', 'I like the idea here and the title. Perhaps a different angle would help - I find the half-reflections of the red cloth distracting.Also, the knife looks scratched.', '2008-03-07 20:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546602, 654670, 53509, '<td valign="top">I like how the spoon really looks embedded in the floor. I think it could be larger in the frame and more in focus.</td>', 'I like how the spoon really looks embedded in the floor. I think it could be larger in the frame and more in focus.', '2008-03-07 20:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546603, 653973, 88054, '<td valign="top">This is really well done.</td>', 'This is really well done.', '2008-03-07 20:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546606, 653697, 53509, '<td valign="top">The soft lighting really works here. The reflections are interesting as well.</td>', 'The soft lighting really works here. The reflections are interesting as well.', '2008-03-07 20:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546634, 653760, 88054, '<td valign="top">The knife is intimidating and makes for a very interesting subject. Great concept and catchy title...too bad her feet have been cropped out of the shot.  Perhaps having your model in the same pose but at a 45 degree angle to the camera would allow a closer crop on the knife and keep her feet in view. Just a thought.</td>', 'The knife is intimidating and makes for a very interesting subject. Great concept and catchy title...too bad her feet have been cropped out of the shot.  Perhaps having your model in the same pose but at a 45 degree angle to the camera would allow a closer crop on the knife and keep her feet in view. Just a thought.', '2008-03-07 20:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546637, 652733, 63218, '<td valign="top">Well, I don''t care what anyone says, I like this one because I do motion-blurred forks myself &amp; they are so much fun.  I am surprised to see this. I will be looking for your score.  I thought about entering a motion-blurred fork but decided to go with a more conventional approach (I''m intimidated by the voters).  I admire your style!</td>', 'Well, I don''t care what anyone says, I like this one because I do motion-blurred forks myself & they are so much fun.  I am surprised to see this. I will be looking for your score.  I thought about entering a motion-blurred fork but decided to go with a more conventional approach (I''m intimidated by the voters).  I admire your style!', '2008-03-07 20:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546643, 653648, 63218, '<td valign="top">admirable reflections, here.</td>', 'admirable reflections, here.', '2008-03-07 20:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546651, 654320, 88054, '<td valign="top">I really like this. The color and grain in the table and texture of the spoon and fork give this a medieval feel. The lighting also lends itself to another time. very nice.</td>', 'I really like this. The color and grain in the table and texture of the spoon and fork give this a medieval feel. The lighting also lends itself to another time. very nice.', '2008-03-07 20:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546679, 654461, 88054, '<td valign="top">I like the subtle detail of this shot. The lighting and background are so simple but the subject is so intricate.</td>', 'I like the subtle detail of this shot. The lighting and background are so simple but the subject is so intricate.', '2008-03-07 20:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546687, 654363, 88010, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been awesome without the three in the background.</td>', 'I think this would have been awesome without the three in the background.', '2008-03-07 20:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546702, 654547, 88054, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky. uneven lighting. Dark spots in the corners. The spoon almost looks frightened or is that a mustache? Can''t tell cause it''s a bit small. Would have liked to see the spoon closer. Cute concept.</td>', 'Beautiful sky. uneven lighting. Dark spots in the corners. The spoon almost looks frightened or is that a mustache? Can''t tell cause it''s a bit small. Would have liked to see the spoon closer. Cute concept.', '2008-03-07 20:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546720, 652858, 88054, '<td valign="top">Now that is talent!</td>', 'Now that is talent!', '2008-03-07 20:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546747, 654033, 88054, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle. Took me a while to figure out what was going on here. Very creative. Colored lights?</td>', 'Interesting angle. Took me a while to figure out what was going on here. Very creative. Colored lights?', '2008-03-07 21:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546766, 652554, 88054, '<td valign="top">Not sure that I like the cropping (angle). Hot spots in the glass are o.k. Gives it a "crystal" feel. Unfortunately the reflection of the photographer in the spoon takes away from the image for me.</td>', 'Not sure that I like the cropping (angle). Hot spots in the glass are o.k. Gives it a "crystal" feel. Unfortunately the reflection of the photographer in the spoon takes away from the image for me.', '2008-03-07 21:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546772, 654501, 88054, '<td valign="top">This is very well done...Great title. I''m unsure how well this will do simply because there are so many quality entries. High marks for creativity. IMO the lighting is near perfect.</td>', 'This is very well done...Great title. I''m unsure how well this will do simply because there are so many quality entries. High marks for creativity. IMO the lighting is near perfect.', '2008-03-07 21:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546808, 654512, 88054, '<td valign="top">This is very artistic. Simple and elegant.</td>', 'This is very artistic. Simple and elegant.', '2008-03-07 21:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546818, 654508, 86306, '<td valign="top">very created i like it ahah 9.</td>', 'very created i like it ahah 9.', '2008-03-07 21:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546819, 654742, 88054, '<td valign="top">Love the colors. Too bad the photographer is visible in the reflection. -1. Perhaps try hiding the camera in the bushes or shadows. Just a thought. Still a quality entry IMO.</td>', 'Love the colors. Too bad the photographer is visible in the reflection. -1. Perhaps try hiding the camera in the bushes or shadows. Just a thought. Still a quality entry IMO.', '2008-03-07 21:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546825, 654739, 88054, '<td valign="top">Great job. I thought about this as well but was afraid the fork would be too small. You pretty much nailed it. Great perspective. One of my top ten.</td>', 'Great job. I thought about this as well but was afraid the fork would be too small. You pretty much nailed it. Great perspective. One of my top ten.', '2008-03-07 21:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546827, 654531, 88054, '<td valign="top">I love the concept. Love the sky...Too bad the fork is so small.</td>', 'I love the concept. Love the sky...Too bad the fork is so small.', '2008-03-07 21:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546835, 652909, 88054, '<td valign="top">Great Idea. Very creative. Love the title.</td>', 'Great Idea. Very creative. Love the title.', '2008-03-07 21:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546845, 653751, 88054, '<td valign="top">This is very creative. I like the fact that the foreground subject is also a painting in the background. Very nice.</td>', 'This is very creative. I like the fact that the foreground subject is also a painting in the background. Very nice.', '2008-03-07 21:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546882, 654772, 88054, '<td valign="top">This is a great image. Very complicated to photograph correctly yet it is the simplicity that I find so intriguing. Love the lighting. One of my favorites. Unfortunately, there are so many quality entries in this challenge that are screaming for attention, I''m afraid most folks are gonna miss the quiet details that make this such a well executed shot. Good luck.</td>', 'This is a great image. Very complicated to photograph correctly yet it is the simplicity that I find so intriguing. Love the lighting. One of my favorites. Unfortunately, there are so many quality entries in this challenge that are screaming for attention, I''m afraid most folks are gonna miss the quiet details that make this such a well executed shot. Good luck.', '2008-03-07 22:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546890, 654773, 88054, '<td valign="top">Background is a bit dark on my monitor but love the idea. A little bit of water in the spoon would have been a nice touch. Quality entry.</td>', 'Background is a bit dark on my monitor but love the idea. A little bit of water in the spoon would have been a nice touch. Quality entry.', '2008-03-07 22:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546891, 654483, 88054, '<td valign="top">The puppy dog seems to be the subject because the knife is slightly out of focus. It is difficult to get a balanced shot with a camera mounted flash at arms length although your pet appreciates the attempt.<br/></td>', 'The puppy dog seems to be the subject because the knife is slightly out of focus. It is difficult to get a balanced shot with a camera mounted flash at arms length although your pet appreciates the attempt.', '2008-03-07 22:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546900, 653536, 12661, '<td valign="top">The expression is priceless, the lighting/balance/tone/etc is dead on. The framing is perfect. The only thing I would have changed is the contents of the spoon. Glass just does not trigger my sense of realism. Perhaps if you borrowed a line from Mary Poppins and made the image "A Spoonful of Sugar".</td>', 'The expression is priceless, the lighting/balance/tone/etc is dead on. The framing is perfect. The only thing I would have changed is the contents of the spoon. Glass just does not trigger my sense of realism. Perhaps if you borrowed a line from Mary Poppins and made the image "A Spoonful of Sugar".', '2008-03-07 22:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546901, 652858, 12661, '<td valign="top">Great expression.</td>', 'Great expression.', '2008-03-07 22:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546903, 653218, 12661, '<td valign="top">The egg in the foreground is a critical part of the photograph. I would have preferred to see it in focus.</td>', 'The egg in the foreground is a critical part of the photograph. I would have preferred to see it in focus.', '2008-03-07 22:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546906, 654652, 12661, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done. My only negative is that I would have used a fork instead of a spoon. That would introduce a sense of culture clash whereas a spoon is used in both the East and the West.</td>', 'Beautifully done. My only negative is that I would have used a fork instead of a spoon. That would introduce a sense of culture clash whereas a spoon is used in both the East and the West.', '2008-03-07 22:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546907, 653091, 12661, '<td valign="top">A nice composition, but perhaps a bit too exposed.</td>', 'A nice composition, but perhaps a bit too exposed.', '2008-03-07 22:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546909, 653503, 12661, '<td valign="top">Nicely done and well framed. It''s also nice to see some silverware without excessive spots and scratched.</td>', 'Nicely done and well framed. It''s also nice to see some silverware without excessive spots and scratched.', '2008-03-07 22:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546914, 654749, 12661, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. I think, however, that a solid background would have given this image more appeal.</td>', 'Nice capture. I think, however, that a solid background would have given this image more appeal.', '2008-03-07 22:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546919, 653504, 12661, '<td valign="top">I nice concept. The use of two different types of forks in the foreground is a bit distracting though. Also, using a deeper ''sky'' blue could have tied the birds theme in better.</td>', 'I nice concept. The use of two different types of forks in the foreground is a bit distracting though. Also, using a deeper ''sky'' blue could have tied the birds theme in better.', '2008-03-07 22:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546922, 653508, 12661, '<td valign="top">Nice symmetry and excellent use of depth of field.</td>', 'Nice symmetry and excellent use of depth of field.', '2008-03-07 22:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546926, 654790, 12661, '<td valign="top">Great job in showing emotion in inanimate objects.</td>', 'Great job in showing emotion in inanimate objects.', '2008-03-07 22:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546939, 654660, 12661, '<td valign="top">Not that I have any idea on how to prevent a convex surface from reflecting just about everything, but the reflection on the bottom spoon is distracting. Perhaps if you had placed them all face up?</td>', 'Not that I have any idea on how to prevent a convex surface from reflecting just about everything, but the reflection on the bottom spoon is distracting. Perhaps if you had placed them all face up?', '2008-03-07 22:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546965, 653333, 88054, '<td valign="top">The spoon and action induced blur in the nose make this feel out of focus. It appears a camera mounted flash was used blowing out the details in your puppies face. It is very difficult to avoid elongated features and get a balanced photo when taking a shot at arms length, although you pet seems to appreciate the attempt. <br/> <br/>It would be better to step back, use a telephoto lens to draw in your subject and use a faster shutter speed to eliminate the blur. Side lighting as opposed to a camera mounted flash will add depth. Good luck.</td>', 'The spoon and action induced blur in the nose make this feel out of focus. It appears a camera mounted flash was used blowing out the details in your puppies face. It is very difficult to avoid elongated features and get a balanced photo when taking a shot at arms length, although you pet seems to appreciate the attempt.  It would be better to step back, use a telephoto lens to draw in your subject and use a faster shutter speed to eliminate the blur. Side lighting as opposed to a camera mounted flash will add depth. Good luck.', '2008-03-07 23:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4547007, 653624, 32837, '<td valign="top">obsolete? what''s the 1337 mean?</td>', 'obsolete? what''s the 1337 mean?', '2008-03-07 23:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4547008, 654712, 32837, '<td valign="top">Wow, you had some time on your hands... Cool shot</td>', 'Wow, you had some time on your hands... Cool shot', '2008-03-07 23:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4547009, 654749, 32837, '<td valign="top">nice POV</td>', 'nice POV', '2008-03-07 23:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4547011, 654045, 32837, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting! Has an intimate feeling to it.</td>', 'Nice lighting! Has an intimate feeling to it.', '2008-03-07 23:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4547013, 654317, 32837, '<td valign="top">Imposing shadows. Kinda Scary looking too.</td>', 'Imposing shadows. Kinda Scary looking too.', '2008-03-07 23:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4547014, 654511, 32837, '<td valign="top">How''d you do that?</td>', 'How''d you do that?', '2008-03-07 23:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4547024, 654334, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed abstract.</td>', 'Nicely composed abstract.', '2008-03-07 23:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4547031, 654709, 41337, '<td valign="top">Pretty lighting.</td>', 'Pretty lighting.', '2008-03-07 23:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4547032, 654678, 32837, '<td valign="top">Maybe you could have thought more about the lighting?</td>', 'Maybe you could have thought more about the lighting?', '2008-03-07 23:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
