(4548718, 654033, 74911, '<td valign="top">Though this is a nice attempt, there are some aspects that makes this image less interesting. IMHO, sharpness and details are lacking, composition is not very appealing. <br/> <br/>If the objective of this image is to show an abstract pattern caused by the fork touching water and the red &amp; white BG, that has not been achieved completely.</td>', 'Though this is a nice attempt, there are some aspects that makes this image less interesting. IMHO, sharpness and details are lacking, composition is not very appealing.  If the objective of this image is to show an abstract pattern caused by the fork touching water and the red & white BG, that has not been achieved completely.', '2008-03-08 17:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4548725, 653281, 74911, '<td valign="top">Nice arramgement of objects. Good use of light. Very appropriate BG. <br/> <br/>You have tried to show the wine drops, but they are not much visible. And also, there is a bit of confusion in where the focus lies, the empty plate or the spoons and forks or the wine glass with drops.</td>', 'Nice arramgement of objects. Good use of light. Very appropriate BG.  You have tried to show the wine drops, but they are not much visible. And also, there is a bit of confusion in where the focus lies, the empty plate or the spoons and forks or the wine glass with drops.', '2008-03-08 17:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
