(4548732, 654612, 74911, '<td valign="top">Amazing use of light and reflections. Excellent sharpness where required. The blue adds interest. One of my favs in this challenge.</td>', 'Amazing use of light and reflections. Excellent sharpness where required. The blue adds interest. One of my favs in this challenge.', '2008-03-08 17:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
