(4549278, 654742, 89277, '<td valign="top">This shot is a tad too busy for me. Maybe if you tightened up on the spoon and used a lower aperture  it would have been more effective. I do like it though.</td>', 'This shot is a tad too busy for me. Maybe if you tightened up on the spoon and used a lower aperture  it would have been more effective. I do like it though.', '2008-03-08 22:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
