(4549371, 653973, 53509, '<td valign="top">Some good dramatic lines created with the fork and the shadow. I find the composition busy - I don''t know what I''m supposed to focus on.</td>', 'Some good dramatic lines created with the fork and the shadow. I find the composition busy - I don''t know what I''m supposed to focus on.', '2008-03-08 23:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
