(4550725, 654719, 90495, '<td valign="top">Good detail on the green moldy stuff. This spoon looks like an antique. I like the bg too, makes it all feel antiquated, like old wall paper.</td>', 'Good detail on the green moldy stuff. This spoon looks like an antique. I like the bg too, makes it all feel antiquated, like old wall paper.', '2008-03-09 20:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550726, 654709, 90495, '<td valign="top">If there were drops on the glass it would look more natural to me. Now, upon seeing it I ask myself why there aren''t any drops on the glass and the answer I get is; they were placed there. Other than that it is a beautiful capture and the lighting is superb, good diffusion. <br/>I also understand the art side to this and that maybe you did every thing possible to not let a darn drop get on your glass because <u>that''s what you wanted.</u> So forget my comment if that''s the case. phew, that was a mouthful.<br/>All the same you get a 9 from me for execution and detail.</td>', 'If there were drops on the glass it would look more natural to me. Now, upon seeing it I ask myself why there aren''t any drops on the glass and the answer I get is; they were placed there. Other than that it is a beautiful capture and the lighting is superb, good diffusion. I also understand the art side to this and that maybe you did every thing possible to not let a darn drop get on your glass because that''s what you wanted. So forget my comment if that''s the case. phew, that was a mouthful.All the same you get a 9 from me for execution and detail.', '2008-03-09 20:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
