(4552319, 653696, 90495, '<td valign="top">That''s one hot fork. Too bad the focus is on the ice and the the subject.</td>', 'That''s one hot fork. Too bad the focus is on the ice and the the subject.', '2008-03-10 13:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
