(4552566, 653560, 80807, '<td valign="top">Other than seeing the photographer in the reflection I really liked this shot<br/>A nice interpertation and the light/background worked well..<br/>other than the reflection....</td>', 'Other than seeing the photographer in the reflection I really liked this shotA nice interpertation and the light/background worked well..other than the reflection....', '2008-03-10 15:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552790, 653951, 15291, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2008-03-10 16:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552796, 654559, 15291, '<td valign="top">A nice image. It just lacks interest.</td>', 'A nice image. It just lacks interest.', '2008-03-10 16:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552799, 654544, 15291, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2008-03-10 16:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552802, 653974, 15291, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2008-03-10 16:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552805, 654652, 15291, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2008-03-10 16:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552814, 654715, 15291, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Seems like it is slightly under exposed.</td>', 'Nice image. Seems like it is slightly under exposed.', '2008-03-10 16:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552898, 653560, 84736, '<td valign="top">The reflection in the spoons are distracting. Also the white isn''t white and the black isn''t black. Maybe you could have tried to get more of the white and black to reflect in the spoons to make it more abstract looking. Curves in PS would have also have helped get the whites and blacks where they should have been.</td>', 'The reflection in the spoons are distracting. Also the white isn''t white and the black isn''t black. Maybe you could have tried to get more of the white and black to reflect in the spoons to make it more abstract looking. Curves in PS would have also have helped get the whites and blacks where they should have been.', '2008-03-10 17:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552899, 654554, 811, '<td valign="top">This is one of those shots that makes me wonder what people that might have seen you may have been thinking. . . .The lengths we go to for dpc!</td>', 'This is one of those shots that makes me wonder what people that might have seen you may have been thinking. . . .The lengths we go to for dpc!', '2008-03-10 17:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552906, 654533, 84736, '<td valign="top">I think this is nice, but maybe just a little too dark. The handle is distracting because it can be barely seen, but is just visible enough to draw your eyes to it. It should have either been lightened or darkened out of view.</td>', 'I think this is nice, but maybe just a little too dark. The handle is distracting because it can be barely seen, but is just visible enough to draw your eyes to it. It should have either been lightened or darkened out of view.', '2008-03-10 17:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552907, 654112, 84736, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice concept and i like it. If you had a cleaning product it the shot it would make a real nice advertisement. Focus is good and the lighting is not harsh or reflecting poorly off of the clean spoon.</td>', 'This is a very nice concept and i like it. If you had a cleaning product it the shot it would make a real nice advertisement. Focus is good and the lighting is not harsh or reflecting poorly off of the clean spoon.', '2008-03-10 17:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552913, 654052, 84736, '<td valign="top">I wish that the top knife was brighter, but it is a nice arrangement and the focus is good. It would have been better to see the bigger knife either straight or at the same angle as the smaller, but thats just my view.</td>', 'I wish that the top knife was brighter, but it is a nice arrangement and the focus is good. It would have been better to see the bigger knife either straight or at the same angle as the smaller, but thats just my view.', '2008-03-10 17:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552923, 652589, 84736, '<td valign="top">This is a very unusual arrangement, but it appeals to me. The lighting and focus are very good. If this is suppose to be juggling of the items, two hands in the frame might have made it more understandable as to what was happening.         Also, I don''t quite understand the pool balls, but I could just be overlooking their significance.</td>', 'This is a very unusual arrangement, but it appeals to me. The lighting and focus are very good. If this is suppose to be juggling of the items, two hands in the frame might have made it more understandable as to what was happening.         Also, I don''t quite understand the pool balls, but I could just be overlooking their significance.', '2008-03-10 17:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552925, 653731, 84736, '<td valign="top">I love the detail, but I feel as though the whites might be blown out in this shot. A different color background might have helped.</td>', 'I love the detail, but I feel as though the whites might be blown out in this shot. A different color background might have helped.', '2008-03-10 17:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552933, 653503, 84736, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. Making good art out of something simple like two forks is a real talent. Good job. My one critique would be that it appears that it may have been ever so slightly over sharpened. The bright specs on the fork tongs are what make me suspect that.</td>', 'I really like this shot. Making good art out of something simple like two forks is a real talent. Good job. My one critique would be that it appears that it may have been ever so slightly over sharpened. The bright specs on the fork tongs are what make me suspect that.', '2008-03-10 17:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552940, 654259, 84736, '<td valign="top">The shallow depth of field causes the handle of the fork to feel distracting to me, but the focus is great.</td>', 'The shallow depth of field causes the handle of the fork to feel distracting to me, but the focus is great.', '2008-03-10 17:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552951, 654218, 84736, '<td valign="top">The crop on this leaves to much negative space on the right side, and the lighting is too warm, as the color cast on the silverware is orange. Also, I think that I am missing the reason for the sliced pear, but the color is nice on that.</td>', 'The crop on this leaves to much negative space on the right side, and the lighting is too warm, as the color cast on the silverware is orange. Also, I think that I am missing the reason for the sliced pear, but the color is nice on that.', '2008-03-10 17:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552994, 654695, 86447, '<td valign="top">Lovely pattern</td>', 'Lovely pattern', '2008-03-10 18:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552995, 653974, 86447, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sharpness and colors.</td>', 'Beautiful sharpness and colors.', '2008-03-10 18:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552996, 653336, 86447, '<td valign="top">Well shot, new take on an old theme...</td>', 'Well shot, new take on an old theme...', '2008-03-10 18:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552999, 653571, 86447, '<td valign="top">Too blurry for anything except a Brown Ribbon, I''m sorry to say.</td>', 'Too blurry for anything except a Brown Ribbon, I''m sorry to say.', '2008-03-10 18:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553001, 654373, 86447, '<td valign="top">Just not exciting, I''m sorry to say... and the lighting could be better.  I like the humor.</td>', 'Just not exciting, I''m sorry to say... and the lighting could be better.  I like the humor.', '2008-03-10 18:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553264, 654764, 84736, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but I feel that the image is hurt by the excess noise and the washed out appearance. Adding some contrast would make it look better.</td>', 'I like the concept, but I feel that the image is hurt by the excess noise and the washed out appearance. Adding some contrast would make it look better.', '2008-03-10 20:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553269, 654720, 84736, '<td valign="top">This is a great pic. The detail and dof are great, the lighting is perfect for the subject, and the exposure is right on. Nice pic.</td>', 'This is a great pic. The detail and dof are great, the lighting is perfect for the subject, and the exposure is right on. Nice pic.', '2008-03-10 20:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553283, 653974, 84736, '<td valign="top">This is a good pic. It is just taken at the right angle of the silverware falling in where you really need to look at it to realize what it is that was dropped in. There is one little black spot on the right that catches my eye, but if cloning were allowed I''m sure it wouldn''t be there. Just thought I''d find something to improve on. Nice job.</td>', 'This is a good pic. It is just taken at the right angle of the silverware falling in where you really need to look at it to realize what it is that was dropped in. There is one little black spot on the right that catches my eye, but if cloning were allowed I''m sure it wouldn''t be there. Just thought I''d find something to improve on. Nice job.', '2008-03-10 20:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553288, 654050, 84736, '<td valign="top">I think the peepes actually take away from the silverware because they are so bright and the lighting is so flat. Also, it might have been a little more interesting if the peeps were in the corners instead of on the edges, but that my opinion.</td>', 'I think the peepes actually take away from the silverware because they are so bright and the lighting is so flat. Also, it might have been a little more interesting if the peeps were in the corners instead of on the edges, but that my opinion.', '2008-03-10 20:10:58.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4553296, 653725, 84736, '<td valign="top">This is quite good, but the reflection in the spoon is distracting. Also, if the plastic spoon were a little more white, it would have stood out better. But the focus and dof work well in this.</td>', 'This is quite good, but the reflection in the spoon is distracting. Also, if the plastic spoon were a little more white, it would have stood out better. But the focus and dof work well in this.', '2008-03-10 20:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553300, 654275, 84736, '<td valign="top">Great idea, very pretty. I don''t have anything else to say.</td>', 'Great idea, very pretty. I don''t have anything else to say.', '2008-03-10 20:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553308, 653874, 84736, '<td valign="top">I really like the teal hue on this shot. It is so simple, but the color makes it much more appealing than a regular fork. DOF is great, but the bright spots above the handle distract. Good job overall.</td>', 'I really like the teal hue on this shot. It is so simple, but the color makes it much more appealing than a regular fork. DOF is great, but the bright spots above the handle distract. Good job overall.', '2008-03-10 20:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553456, 654317, 91258, '<td valign="top">Great concept!! Love the shadows!</td>', 'Great concept!! Love the shadows!', '2008-03-10 21:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553719, 654698, 90806, '<td valign="top">I like the concept and colors, though the reflections from the overhead lights are distracting as I find my eyes searching for a point to focus on.  Drinks might have made the glasses look less empty as well, though that may have been intentional with the minimal food element.</td>', 'I like the concept and colors, though the reflections from the overhead lights are distracting as I find my eyes searching for a point to focus on.  Drinks might have made the glasses look less empty as well, though that may have been intentional with the minimal food element.', '2008-03-10 23:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
