(4556031, 652885, 83313, '<td valign="top">JPEG police here... Your file size is a lot smaller than was allowed. You have lost some clarity to JPEG compression. The dark image hides a lot of it, but I can see compression artifacts around the "plates" and "utensils" on the table. You''ve surely lost a lot of additional detail due to this. Check the JPEG compression settings in your image editor and always try to save as close to the limit for a challenge as you can get it without going over.<br/> <br/>A creative scene. I appreciate the thought that went into putting this together..</td>', 'JPEG police here... Your file size is a lot smaller than was allowed. You have lost some clarity to JPEG compression. The dark image hides a lot of it, but I can see compression artifacts around the "plates" and "utensils" on the table. You''ve surely lost a lot of additional detail due to this. Check the JPEG compression settings in your image editor and always try to save as close to the limit for a challenge as you can get it without going over. A creative scene. I appreciate the thought that went into putting this together..', '2008-03-11 20:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
