(4556658, 654045, 68504, '<td valign="top">Sedate?  Is that the word?  Wouldn''t have thought it was you until I examined the photo more closely, and even then... The ever so subtle mirroring of flower pattern in the china cup which you managed to include in your narrow DOF: what a treat!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-03-12 00:39:44.</i></td>', 'Sedate?  Is that the word?  Wouldn''t have thought it was you until I examined the photo more closely, and even then... The ever so subtle mirroring of flower pattern in the china cup which you managed to include in your narrow DOF: what a treat!', '2008-03-12 00:37:53.000000', '2008-03-12 00:39:44.000000', 0),
(4556686, 654045, 56880, '<td valign="top">I had a special spoon growing up; I found it under my mom''s car one day, and used it (after washing it, of course) for about 20 years before it got lost in a move.<br/> <br/>Nice tones in your shot, and excellent DOF on the handle.</td>', 'I had a special spoon growing up; I found it under my mom''s car one day, and used it (after washing it, of course) for about 20 years before it got lost in a move. Nice tones in your shot, and excellent DOF on the handle.', '2008-03-12 00:47:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4556693, 653655, 68504, '<td valign="top">Love the idea.  And I like your reflection in the spoon which is nice and blurry shiny.</td>', 'Love the idea.  And I like your reflection in the spoon which is nice and blurry shiny.', '2008-03-12 00:50:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4556708, 653731, 60862, '<td valign="top">Heh.  I noticed the scratches on my silverware, too.  Just say it adds character. ;)<br/> <br/>Congrats on another high score!</td>', 'Heh.  I noticed the scratches on my silverware, too.  Just say it adds character. ;) Congrats on another high score!', '2008-03-12 00:56:43.000000', NULL, 0),
