(4556978, 654688, 41337, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Brad:</b></div><hr/><i> This really should have scored MUCH higher Shannon.<br/>Wondering why this only reached 17th place raises my eye to friends voting. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Are you saying Shannon doesn''t have any friends? :P There were a few odd high scores in this one. 6.4 does seem a bit low for this shot especially for basic editing.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-03-12 04:54:29.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Brad: This really should have scored MUCH higher Shannon.Wondering why this only reached 17th place raises my eye to friends voting.   Are you saying Shannon doesn''t have any friends? :P There were a few odd high scores in this one. 6.4 does seem a bit low for this shot especially for basic editing.', '2008-03-12 03:13:00.000000', '2008-03-12 04:54:29.000000', 0),
(4556980, 654045, 67258, '<td valign="top">I didn''t look at the silverware challenge while it was in voting, so this is new to me - it''s lovely!  The composition is really pretty, and the tonal range is superb, really bringing the pattern in the spoon out.  I gather you don''t normally drink tea - shock, horror!</td>', 'I didn''t look at the silverware challenge while it was in voting, so this is new to me - it''s lovely!  The composition is really pretty, and the tonal range is superb, really bringing the pattern in the spoon out.  I gather you don''t normally drink tea - shock, horror!', '2008-03-12 03:13:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4556985, 653336, 68586, '<td valign="top">Aimee - a well deserved ribbon. Love the colour and movement in this.<br/> <br/>On top of that you get the bragging rights in the house this week :- )</td>', 'Aimee - a well deserved ribbon. Love the colour and movement in this. On top of that you get the bragging rights in the house this week :- )', '2008-03-12 03:15:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4556991, 654478, 68586, '<td valign="top">Tim lovely shot with a simple elegance to it. <br/> <br/>Hmmm . . I wonder what a phycho-analyst would say about these two ''Too'' shots ? <br/> <br/>One simple and straightforward, one bursting with energy and movement  :- )<br/> <br/>Lol - question is - is a 3rd and 4th the highest family placing we''ve yet seen on DPC ? You might just be holding a husband / wife record here.</td>', 'Tim lovely shot with a simple elegance to it.  Hmmm . . I wonder what a phycho-analyst would say about these two ''Too'' shots ?  One simple and straightforward, one bursting with energy and movement  :- ) Lol - question is - is a 3rd and 4th the highest family placing we''ve yet seen on DPC ? You might just be holding a husband / wife record here.', '2008-03-12 03:24:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4556996, 654045, 68586, '<td valign="top">Deb, very nice shot. Great DoF and PoV. <br/> <br/>Lovely patterns in the cup and spoon.<br/> <br/>P.S. I notice you only showed us the clean end of the spoon  :- P</td>', 'Deb, very nice shot. Great DoF and PoV.  Lovely patterns in the cup and spoon. P.S. I notice you only showed us the clean end of the spoon  :- P', '2008-03-12 03:31:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4556999, 654544, 68586, '<td valign="top">Christiane - congrats on your top 30 finish, and the second time you''ve beaten Oliver recently. Is there a pattern forming here?<br/> <br/>  :- )<br/> <br/></td>', 'Christiane - congrats on your top 30 finish, and the second time you''ve beaten Oliver recently. Is there a pattern forming here?   :- ) ', '2008-03-12 03:35:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4557000, 654511, 65713, '<td valign="top">With reflection shots I often dislike how clear the surface is and how it distracts from the actual subject. That said this shot is beautiful and the reflection works really well, I really love the DOF you chose. Great shot and congrats on your high placement, sorry I missed voting in this challenge.</td>', 'With reflection shots I often dislike how clear the surface is and how it distracts from the actual subject. That said this shot is beautiful and the reflection works really well, I really love the DOF you chose. Great shot and congrats on your high placement, sorry I missed voting in this challenge.', '2008-03-12 03:36:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4557001, 652831, 30982, '<td valign="top">I think this is well done.  There''s an unspoken kind of sadness to this.</td>', 'I think this is well done.  There''s an unspoken kind of sadness to this.', '2008-03-12 03:37:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4557005, 654749, 30982, '<td valign="top">Did you and the better half of the Toos collaborate?  :-)  I should have known this was yours by the signature color.  Sorry about the Enzo thing, though.</td>', 'Did you and the better half of the Toos collaborate?  :-)  I should have known this was yours by the signature color.  Sorry about the Enzo thing, though.', '2008-03-12 03:39:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4557008, 654546, 68586, '<td valign="top">Oliver - there''s much to like about this, I love how bright the green background is in this, really bold and punchy, nice crop and almost minimillist feel about the fork with just a touch of (nicely arranged) food on it.<br/> <br/>The only thing that I''m not sure about if the different colours on the fork itself. I think a clean shiny, silver fork would have picked up more points.<br/> <br/>Still a good shot though  :- )</td>', 'Oliver - there''s much to like about this, I love how bright the green background is in this, really bold and punchy, nice crop and almost minimillist feel about the fork with just a touch of (nicely arranged) food on it. The only thing that I''m not sure about if the different colours on the fork itself. I think a clean shiny, silver fork would have picked up more points. Still a good shot though  :- )', '2008-03-12 03:42:09.000000', NULL, 0),
