(4557258, 654762, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  How terribly sordid.  I can see the tabloid headlines now.... Are you sure that woody isn''t by chance a senator?  You made a lot of people smile and in my book, that''s a good thing.  All you needed was a Motel 6 neon logo in the background, or something equally tacky.</td>', 'LOL!  How terribly sordid.  I can see the tabloid headlines now.... Are you sure that woody isn''t by chance a senator?  You made a lot of people smile and in my book, that''s a good thing.  All you needed was a Motel 6 neon logo in the background, or something equally tacky.', '2008-03-12 07:20:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4557260, 654317, 32767, '<td valign="top">Great idea...great shot. Cheers!</td>', 'Great idea...great shot. Cheers!', '2008-03-12 07:22:14.000000', NULL, 0),
