(4563839, 654712, 32933, '<td valign="top">Coolest. Thing. <u>Ever.</u> <br/> <br/>I like the photograph itself, too. The shadows don''t make it seem like too perfect of a photo, and the colors are really appealing to me. I just have the slightest problem with the tip of the one fork at the bottom, but I can''t crop my way out of a paper sack, so I don''t see why I''m talking. :) That one fork, though, now that I look at it, doesn''t look like it''s bent. Like, the lighting on the handle looks like it is, but it looks 2-D, you know?<br/> <br/>I''ve got to say this, though, in relation to <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=58457" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tpbremer</a>. "Forkpion" is the most outlandish-sounding thing I''ve heard anyone come up with, and that makes the comment hilarious to me.</td>', 'Coolest. Thing. Ever.  I like the photograph itself, too. The shadows don''t make it seem like too perfect of a photo, and the colors are really appealing to me. I just have the slightest problem with the tip of the one fork at the bottom, but I can''t crop my way out of a paper sack, so I don''t see why I''m talking. :) That one fork, though, now that I look at it, doesn''t look like it''s bent. Like, the lighting on the handle looks like it is, but it looks 2-D, you know? I''ve got to say this, though, in relation to  tpbremer. "Forkpion" is the most outlandish-sounding thing I''ve heard anyone come up with, and that makes the comment hilarious to me.', '2008-03-14 12:05:39.000000', NULL, 0),
