(4599628, 654045, 53316, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous. It needs to be a big print in a kitchen or cafe somewhere, seriously.  It''s just very crisp yet soft, and perfect, and... yeah, I am getting all flustered because I have no words to match how awesome this is, hehe!!</td>', 'This is gorgeous. It needs to be a big print in a kitchen or cafe somewhere, seriously.  It''s just very crisp yet soft, and perfect, and... yeah, I am getting all flustered because I have no words to match how awesome this is, hehe!!', '2008-03-31 19:22:30.000000', NULL, 0),
