(4599849, 654522, 90495, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 9. But looking at it again it looks oof for most of the image. Still, it should have scored a bit higher in the 30''s.</td>', 'I gave this a 9. But looking at it again it looks oof for most of the image. Still, it should have scored a bit higher in the 30''s.', '2008-03-31 21:07:05.000000', NULL, 0),
