(4600150, 654712, 20889, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Fetor:</b></div><hr/><i> so are done with it, how about ebaying it? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>That did not cross my mind, lmao. But though about selling it to the highest bidder on here. :-Þ</td>', 'Originally posted by Fetor: so are done with it, how about ebaying it?   That did not cross my mind, lmao. But though about selling it to the highest bidder on here. :-Þ', '2008-03-31 23:40:43.000000', NULL, 0),
