(4605793, 654569, 30982, '<td valign="top">I do like the minimalist approach you have going in challenges this year.  Will make a nifty series!</td>', 'I do like the minimalist approach you have going in challenges this year.  Will make a nifty series!', '2008-04-02 07:50:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4607159, 654045, 69557, '<td valign="top">this is one amazing picture. the dof is perfect, the spoon with the pattern, the composition - all absolutely perfect. i can''t imagine anyone giving this a 1/2, that''s bizarre!</td>', 'this is one amazing picture. the dof is perfect, the spoon with the pattern, the composition - all absolutely perfect. i can''t imagine anyone giving this a 1/2, that''s bizarre!', '2008-04-02 14:08:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4611599, 652634, 91110, '<td valign="top">The color rendition seems a little too orange. Lower your ISO, and mount on tripod for a blur free photo. Good job.</td>', 'The color rendition seems a little too orange. Lower your ISO, and mount on tripod for a blur free photo. Good job.', '2008-04-03 18:15:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4652322, 654569, 87808, '<td valign="top">oh I love it, that is gorgeous!!</td>', 'oh I love it, that is gorgeous!!', '2008-04-21 21:45:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4656447, 654317, 46448, '<td valign="top">Dude Awesome shot! Nice to see another Olympus user in the Blue Ribbon!</td>', 'Dude Awesome shot! Nice to see another Olympus user in the Blue Ribbon!', '2008-04-23 22:09:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4706953, 654317, 60383, '<td valign="top">I just printed this pic out on my home printer and it''s hanging in my kitchen now. Simply wonderful picture.</td>', 'I just printed this pic out on my home printer and it''s hanging in my kitchen now. Simply wonderful picture.', '2008-05-16 15:40:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4714946, 653395, 93760, '<td valign="top">Very Nice.</td>', 'Very Nice.', '2008-05-21 12:10:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4717195, 653504, 48228, '<td valign="top">This was very clever set up, and it totally works for me. <br/>I am disappointed that it did not score higher than it did, as it deserved a much higher placement IMO.....<br/>I like the placement of the forks, also like the composition. <br/>The Dof and the softness, balances the focused detail areas well.....</td>', 'This was very clever set up, and it totally works for me. I am disappointed that it did not score higher than it did, as it deserved a much higher placement IMO.....I like the placement of the forks, also like the composition. The Dof and the softness, balances the focused detail areas well.....', '2008-05-22 10:06:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4733641, 654478, 48228, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea, and composition.....</td>', 'Excellent idea, and composition.....', '2008-05-29 22:38:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4800548, 654320, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is indeed a very cool pattern for silverware!  I like the warmness of the tones here, but if you want, you can try "blue-ing" the white balance a little to cool it and brighten it a bit.  Try using selective color - take some yellow out of the reds, and add a bit of cyan.  Or if it was shot in RAW, you can just turn the temp down a few degrees before you import it into Photoshop.</td>', 'This is indeed a very cool pattern for silverware!  I like the warmness of the tones here, but if you want, you can try "blue-ing" the white balance a little to cool it and brighten it a bit.  Try using selective color - take some yellow out of the reds, and add a bit of cyan.  Or if it was shot in RAW, you can just turn the temp down a few degrees before you import it into Photoshop.', '2008-07-03 03:28:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4860286, 654203, 48228, '<td valign="top"><b>A W E S O N E.....</b> So deserved to ribbon.....</td>', 'A W E S O N E..... So deserved to ribbon.....', '2008-08-02 23:12:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4871913, 654511, 37430, '<td valign="top">Forks are done to death....but this one stands apart :) Great composition!</td>', 'Forks are done to death....but this one stands apart :) Great composition!', '2008-08-07 01:27:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4907704, 654320, 49804, '<td valign="top">Nice shallow dof, i also like the composition and colors, nicely done here.</td>', 'Nice shallow dof, i also like the composition and colors, nicely done here.', '2008-08-24 13:36:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4919965, 654045, 52549, '<td valign="top">Hi Deb, just came across this beauty. Love the DOF, love the scene you''ve set. The b/w toning is perfect for the mood (you can tell I like it ;-)</td>', 'Hi Deb, just came across this beauty. Love the DOF, love the scene you''ve set. The b/w toning is perfect for the mood (you can tell I like it ;-)', '2008-08-29 16:05:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4928757, 654445, 48228, '<td valign="top">Well I do not know why but i just really like this.....</td>', 'Well I do not know why but i just really like this.....', '2008-09-02 21:29:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4955992, 654203, 47906, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful, I love the lighting and the smoke that is in the shot. I love the small spot above that comes down and falls on the spoon. very beautiful shot. Congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'This is beautiful, I love the lighting and the smoke that is in the shot. I love the small spot above that comes down and falls on the spoon. very beautiful shot. Congrats on the ribbon.', '2008-09-15 10:26:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5118512, 654317, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting optical illusion. When I first looked at it I saw white plastic spoons, then spoons and forks, then I finally saw the forks. Love the light in this. But I''m sure many, many people have had wonderful things to say about your image.</td>', 'This is an interesting optical illusion. When I first looked at it I saw white plastic spoons, then spoons and forks, then I finally saw the forks. Love the light in this. But I''m sure many, many people have had wonderful things to say about your image.', '2008-12-08 23:34:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5168892, 654045, 61651, '<td valign="top">So amazingly simple, and soothing - like a nice hot cup of tea.</td>', 'So amazingly simple, and soothing - like a nice hot cup of tea.', '2009-01-03 23:03:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5194719, 653504, 46314, '<td valign="top">I think this should have scored higher than it did. It''s a great photo - well done.</td>', 'I think this should have scored higher than it did. It''s a great photo - well done.', '2009-01-16 08:28:52.000000', NULL, 0),
