(5586266, 652918, 87808, '<td valign="top">It is a pair fo forks hard to make artistic at the best of time.  You coulld have flipped the canvas so that they where standing up upright, that instantly gives it a different angle and looks more interesting , it need some depthmaybe a soft billowing cloth behind it to add some curves and depths</td>', 'It is a pair fo forks hard to make artistic at the best of time.  You coulld have flipped the canvas so that they where standing up upright, that instantly gives it a different angle and looks more interesting , it need some depthmaybe a soft billowing cloth behind it to add some curves and depths', '2009-07-25 17:54:06.000000', NULL, 0),
